the knowledge base n0114_min_collect_hitpolicy includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/0114-min-collect-hitpolicy.dmn".

rule car_insurance_1 with provenance the model at decision CarInsurance:
the car insurance is a number N if
    N is the minimum of each V such that
        the num of years is a second number
        and the car insurance for the second number is a value V under table car_insurance.

